 card to ensure compatibility with this product."]],"deck":2,"blurb":"Fleet command in three-dimensional space is the focus of the Homeworld Remastered Collection, which packages Homeworld and Homeworld 2 as updated real-time strategy games along with remastered multiplayer, plus the original versions as a bonus. Players gather resources, research technology and build ships from small fighters up to large carriers, then choose formations and tactics for each mission. More than thirty single-player missions are included across the campaigns.\n\nBecause battles take place in full 3D, positioning and approach angle matter more than they do in typical ground-based RTS games. People from the original development team contributed to the remasters. The collection suits strategy fans who want a campaign-driven space fleet game with room to plan."}}